    "description": "The Patient Records Retrieval API provides secure access to individuals' health records within the healthcare system. This endpoint allows authorized users, such as healthcare providers and patients, to retrieve detailed medical history and documentation associated with a specific patient. It streamlines the process of accessing vital health information, ensuring continuity of care and informed decision-making. Typical consumers of this API include care teams, health systems, and patient management applications looking to enhance their service offerings.",
